<title>UK: Carlton off on report of bid for Rank unit.</title>
<headline>Carlton off on report of bid for Rank unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Carlton Communications Plc tumbled on Friday after The Times said the UK media group is one of the contenders for Rank Group Plc's film distribution business, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0956 GMT, the shares were down 11-1/2p to 520p, but volume was light with only 148,151 shares changing hands.</p>
<p>Carlton would neither confirm nor deny it was one of the bidders for the business, which was placed up for sale last week, the paper said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
